Rafaela Machado Gengo, Caio Arthur Santos, Renato Moraes, and Gergely Andres Julio Szabó. O uso de pseudosseções em Petrologia Metamórfica: conceitos básicos e aplicações, com ênfase em pelitos. Geologia USP, Série Científica 22(1), 2022. DOI [10.11606/issn.2316-9095.v22-186131](https://doi.org/10.11606/issn.2316-9095.v22-186131). [Official article, full-text route, and references](https://revistas.usp.br/guspsc/article/view/195248).

Read the complete Portuguese article before an advanced metapelite calculation, comparing principles, topology, composition systems, and practical choices with the English review and model documentation. Its bibliography connects the introductory treatment with primary thermodynamic and Brazilian petrochronological research.

